# FAIL witness 050 (P2 BYOK/SKR): a settlement completion without an
# attestation fingerprint — the 050 law is the ONLY law broken
# (no entries, batches, or stores; every other gate silent).
@prefix fin: <https://ggen.io/ontology/financial-ledger#> .

fin:enrich-done a fin:SettlementCompletion ;
    fin:completesStage fin:Enrich .
    # no fin:attestationFingerprint — the refusal
